# Sprintware is a PURE CET (Lua) mod — no archive, no redscript, no TweakXL — so it has no
# WolvenKit project either. It used to: the Lua sat under source/resources/bin/x64/plugins/...
# and WolvenKit "packed" it into a zip of exactly the files that were already there. That bought
# nothing, so it was flattened on 2026-07-14 and the WolvenKit scaffolding deleted.
#
# The layout is now `sprintware/` at the repo root — the folder exactly as it lands in
# bin\x64\plugins\cyber_engine_tweaks\mods\. deploy-mod.ps1 calls this layout 4 and handles it.
# Do NOT reintroduce a source/ or packed/ tree unless the mod gains a real archive.

# Distribution archives
*.zip

# Nexus images (screenshots, headers, GIMP source)
Images/
images/
*.xcf

# Editor
.vscode/
.history/
*.log

# Local Claude Code orientation file. Machine-specific working notes;
# never published, never in git. See wiki: decisions/per-mod-claude-md-superseded
CLAUDE.md
